@host = http://localhost:5254

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health

### LLM reachability
GET {{host}}/health/llm

### Chat WITH evidence fragments → grounded answer (calls the model)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "¿Cada cuánto se revisa el extintor?",
  "fragments": [
    {
      "content": "Los extintores portátiles deben inspeccionarse mensualmente y recargarse según la norma.",
      "documentId": "manual-sst-2024",
      "documentTitle": "Manual SST",
      "page": "12",
      "section": "4.3 Extintores"
    }
  ]
}

### Chat WITHOUT fragments → fail-closed abstention (no model call)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "¿Cada cuánto se revisa el extintor?"
}
